{
  "ALL_TEXT": "119 INT. MINISTER'S HOUSE-DINGY ROOM - NIGHT \nThe FOREST MINISTER's goons have GOVARDHAN, SULOCHANA and \nVEDA tied up. The goons clear out a path, as the FOREST \nMINISTER enters the room. \nCHINTHAN BABA \nEe muggure.... anna ee muggure.... \nveelle thisukellaaru \nFOREST MINISTER \n(loudly) \nEkkadundhi Briefcase? \nNo one responds. The FOREST MINISTER slowly starts walking \ntowards a door. \nFOREST MINISTER \nNenu modhalupettinappudu ee \nsevaalanni ela odhilinchukovaalo \nardham ayyedhi kaadhu..paatha \nsamaadhuluni tavvi daantlo \npaathesevaadini kaani aedho oka \nporapaatu jarigedhi...okasaari maa \nvaadu oka English cinema loo \nchusaadu...sevaalanni pandhula toh \netla odhilinchukuntaaro...Pandhulu \nmanishula bokkale \nnavalesthaayi...aina manushula \nsevalu chaala bhaari gaa untaayi. \nHe knocks on a door, a secret code knock - twice, a pause, \nonce, a pause, a third time.. \nFOREST MINISTER \nNijamga perfect gaa cheyaalante aa \nsevam ni aaru mukkalu gaa \nnarakaali....daani kosam em kaavalo \nthelusaa... \nThe door opens \nFOREST MINISTER \nKasaayi sainyam... \nInside the door is a small room, all walls covered in \nplastic, four big men wearing leather aprons, bloody cleavers \nin hand. One standing next to the door, Two cleaning up their \nblades, and the fourth stuffing something into a gunny bag \none among four lying on the floor. \nFOREST MINISTER \nAipoinda.. \nThe BUTCHER at the door doesn\u2019t answer \nFOREST MINISTER \nMaatlaadu.. \nBUTCHER \nMeeru tappu password \nkottaaru...nenu mee tho \nmaatlaadakudadhu.. \nFOREST MINISTER \nYedhava..idhi nenu...cheppu \nBUTCHER \nNaaku ela telusthundhi edhi meere \nani? Aa? Asalu ela? Idhi matrix \ncinema laantidhi aithe? \nFOREST MINISTER \n(irritated) \nMalli aa gaanja kodtunnaavaa? \nBUTCHER \nLedhu...meeru meere naa kaadha ani \ndoubt gaa undhi \nVEDA \nNijamga sir, maakem thelidhu. Aame \nSULOCHANA, journalist. Ithanu \nGOVARDHAN \nGOVARDHAN \nBank employee nee \nVEDA \nNenu VEDA, software engineer.. \nAnthe sir, maaku dheeniki \nsambhandham ledhu. \nASSISTANT GOON \nAe company? \nVEDA \nNenu idhi varaku software engineer, \ncognizant lo... \nASSISTANT GOON \navuna...eppdu join ayyaavu? \nVEDA \nASSISTANT GOON \nSeptember lo naa? \nVEDA \nAvunu.. \nASSISTANT GOON \nOh super..neeku Srija telusa? \nVEDA \n....kalla jodu, tella ga untada? \nASSISTANT GOON \nTight ass \nAvunu \nEnti? \nVEDA \nSULOCHANA \nVEDA \nkaadhu...neeku kudaa adhe nachuthe \ntappadhu.. \nASSISTANT GOON \nmast hot undedhi dude...nannu \nreject chesindhi college lo \n...bitch \nFOREST MINISTER \n(yells) \nAapandi ee circus. Andharu! Mee \nmugguru, mee daggara 45 minutes \nunnaayi...cheptaara lendante kasai \nsainyaani daggara pampamantaara? \nBUTCHER \nEe roju ki pani aipoindhi..ippudu \nvelthe traffic nee tappinchukovachu \nFOREST MINISTER \nArdharaathiri varaku pani \ncheyi...ee vedhavala pani chusi po \nBUTCHER \nNuvvu nijamgaane forest minister vi \nThe LEAD GOON enters \nLEAD GOON \nSir madam vocharu \nFOREST MINISTER \nAe madam ra \nLEAD GOON \nChinna illu madam \nFOREST MINISTER \nAdhi enthuku vochindhi ikkadiki \nippudu... \nLEAD GOON \nNaakem thelusu saar \nFOREST MINISTER \nSare...pada \nThe FOREST MINISTER exits the room. \nCUT TO: ",
